      "source": "Helper method that provides a null-safe way to convert a <code>String[]</code> to a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> for client libraries to use.",
