      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the ciphers that can be used or <code>null</code>. The cipher names in this set\nshould be compatible with those supported by\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/javax/net/ssl/SSLEngine.html#getSupportedCipherSuites()\" title=\"class or interface in javax.net.ssl\"><code>SSLEngine.getSupportedCipherSuites()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回可使用的加密套件，或返回`null`。此集合中的加密套件名称应与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/javax/net/ssl/SSLEngine.html#getSupportedCipherSuites()\" title=\"class or interface in javax.net.ssl\"><code>SSLEngine.getSupportedCipherSuites()</code></a>支持的那些兼容。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the protocols that should be enabled or <code>null</code>. The protocols names in\nthis set should be compatible with those supported by\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/javax/net/ssl/SSLEngine.html#getSupportedProtocols()\" title=\"class or interface in javax.net.ssl\"><code>SSLEngine.getSupportedProtocols()</code></a>.",
